  "question": "1. Business Requirements Description (Translated):\nThe Public Facility Maintenance System is designed to help a city’s management organization oversee various public facilities such as streetlights, parks, and bridges. The system needs to manage the following aspects:\nEach facility should have a unique Facility ID, Name, Location, Responsible Person, and Creation Date.The system should record the maintenance details for each facility, including Maintenance Time, Maintenance Content, Maintenance Personnel, and Maintenance Costs.Track the Usage Time, Usage Frequency, and User Feedback for each facility.Each user has a unique User ID and Name, and their interactions with the facilities are also recorded in the system.",
  "ddl": "-- Schema for database: rschema_0207\nCREATE TABLE `users` (\n  `user_id` int(11) NOT NULL AUTO_INCREMENT,\n  `name` varchar(255) NOT NULL,\n  PRIMARY KEY (`user_id`)\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb3;\n\nCREATE TABLE `facilities` (\n  `facility_id` int(11) NOT NULL AUTO_INCREMENT,\n  `name` varchar(255) NOT NULL,\n  `location` varchar(255) NOT NULL,\n  `responsible_person` varchar(255) NOT NULL,\n  `creation_date` datetime NOT NULL,\n  `usage_time` int(11) DEFAULT NULL,\n  `usage_frequency` int(11) DEFAULT NULL,\n  `user_feedback` varchar(1000) DEFAULT NULL,\n  PRIMARY KEY (`facility_id`)\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb3;\n\nCREATE TABLE `maintenance_records` (\n  `maintenance_id` int(11) NOT NULL AUTO_INCREMENT,\n  `facility_id` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  `maintenance_time` datetime NOT NULL,\n  `maintenance_content` varchar(1000) NOT NULL,\n  `maintenance_personnel` varchar(255) NOT NULL,\n  `maintenance_costs` decimal(10,2) NOT NULL,\n  PRIMARY KEY (`maintenance_id`),\n  KEY `maintenance_records_ibfk_1` (`facility_id`),\n  CONSTRAINT `maintenance_records_ibfk_1` FOREIGN KEY (`facility_id`) REFERENCES `facilities` (`facility_id`) ON DELETE CASCADE ON UPDATE CASCADE\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb3;\n\nCREATE TABLE `facility_user_interactions` (\n  `interaction_id` int(11) NOT NULL AUTO_INCREMENT,\n  `facility_id` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  `user_id` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  `interaction_time` datetime NOT NULL,\n  `interaction_type` varchar(255) DEFAULT NULL,\n  `feedback` varchar(1000) DEFAULT NULL,\n  PRIMARY KEY (`interaction_id`),\n  KEY `facility_user_interactions_ibfk_1` (`facility_id`),\n  KEY `facility_user_interactions_ibfk_2` (`user_id`),\n  CONSTRAINT `facility_user_interactions_ibfk_1` FOREIGN KEY (`facility_id`) REFERENCES `facilities` (`facility_id`) ON DELETE CASCADE ON UPDATE CASCADE,\n  CONSTRAINT `facility_user_interactions_ibfk_2` FOREIGN KEY (`user_id`) REFERENCES `users` (`user_id`) ON DELETE CASCADE ON UPDATE CASCADE\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb3;",
